{
  "job_B14.45_20251003_114317": {
    "chunk_text": "he m\u00e6ig nyt beon & \u00f0a nytte don, \u00f0e him fylstan scylan; huru is m\u00e6st Me m\u00e6ig in Maio & Iunio & Iulio on sumera fealgian, myxendincgan ut dragan, lochyrdla tilian, sceap On h\u00e6rfeste ripan, in Agusto & Septembri & Octobri mawan, wad spittan, fela til\u00f0a ham g\u00e6derian, On wintra erian & in miclum gefyrstum timber cleofan, orceard r\u00e6ran & m\u00e6nige inweorc wyrcean, On l\u00e6ngtene eregian & impian, beana sawan, wingeard settan, dician, deorhege heawan & ra\u00f0e \u00e6fter A he m\u00e6ig findan, hw\u00e6t he m\u00e6ig on byrig betan ne \u00f0earf he na unnyt beon, \u00f0onne he \u00f0\u00e6r binnan bi\u00f0: He sceal fela tola to tune tilian & fela andlomena to husan habban. \u00c6cse, adsan, bil, byrse, scafan, sage, cimbiren, tigehoc, n\u00e6febor, mattuc, ippingiren, scear, culter & eac & fela towtola: flexlinan, spinle, reol, gearnwindan, stodlan, lorgas, presse, pihten, timplean, wifte, And gif he smeawyrhtan h\u00e6f\u00f0, \u00f0am he sceal to tolan fylstan: mylewerde, sutere, leodgotan & o\u00f0ran Man sceal habban w\u00e6ngew\u00e6du, sulhgesidu, ege\u00f0getigu & fela \u00f0inga, \u00f0e ic nu gen\u00e6mnian ne can, ge Hit is earfo\u00f0e eall to gesecganne, \u00fe\u00e6t se be\u00f0encan sceal, \u00f0e scire healt. Ne sceolde he nan \u00f0ing forgyman, \u00f0e \u00e6fre",
